            rdfs:label "ANM, National Meteorological Administration, Romania"@en ;
            foaf:homepage <https://www.meteoromania.ro/> .


###  http://harmoni-project.eu/ontology#ANMMonitoringNetwork
harmoni:ANMMonitoringNetwork rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
