###  http://harmoni-project.eu/ontology#EDODroughtIndicators
harmoni:EDODroughtIndicators rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      dcat:Dataset ;
                             harmoni:hasAccessTier harmoni:OpenAccess ;
